{"title":"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> colored beads are placed on a necklace (circular ring) such that each bead is adjacent to two others. The beads are labeled <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/5/ee5c7c921b3334f6ecf58c241eeea42acf0ce71e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/5/3958e984d2597b35da7975f4503cdcf965a777f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ldots$\" width=\"19\" height=\"2\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820332d75715e0966c46780224431503de43b34a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2005}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"10\" /> around the circle in order. Two beads <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412787c048e28774dc63fc27db42dc52ca858de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/8/0785f19824c8b23ab3dfe000b471994078fdf589.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"15\" height=\"12\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/2/8122aa89ea6e80784c6513d22787ad86e36ad0cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"10\" height=\"17\" /> are non-negative integers, satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/a/eda8881f130a4e10be6eab9663cb6526ed1bf3db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i = a_j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"12\" /> if and only if the color of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412787c048e28774dc63fc27db42dc52ca858de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> is the same as the color of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/8/0785f19824c8b23ab3dfe000b471994078fdf589.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"15\" height=\"12\" />. Given that there exists no non-negative integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/a/83acea62fcc41cc5383b7abbb8192af8e4722d5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m &lt; 2006$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"75\" height=\"13\" /> and positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/0/36028d26540f03f967194cf4013848b578103999.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &lt; 1003$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/0/020188740b2328b3a14149ca6638539c9bad14a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_m = a_{m-n} = a_{m+n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"12\" />, where all subscripts are taken <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/d/8dd7fddfe70c61b06c1020beda07520c26fef844.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pmod{2006}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" />, find the minimum number of different colors of beads on the necklace.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006\">Mock AIME 5 2005-2006</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=76847\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017133348\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 153/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1445/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 203/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2764/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    9.002      1 Template:Mock_AIME_box\n100.00%    9.002      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13380:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017133348 and revision id 64730. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}